abstract: >-
  Diagnostic signal reference for the Honda Civic Type R (FL5), covering 25 data
  identifiers and 109 signals read over OBD-II with UDS service 22 (read-only).
  Every signal carries a confidence level, a one-line statement of the evidence
  behind it, and the capture session that established it; claims that were later
  overturned are published together with what the mistake was.
